G2 -- is f_DM prior-driven?  (RC41 overlap, actual SED + gas)
======================================================================================================================
  Delta_prior = log M_bar,fit - log(M* + M_gas): median -0.097 dex (n = 41); Spearman rho(delta_flat, Delta_prior) = +0.07 (p = 0.682)
  Theil-Sen slope of delta_flat on Delta_prior +0.053; z-slope of delta_flat after removing it: +0.212 [+0.155, +0.271] (n = 41)
  -> prior-driven (|rho| >= 0.3 and p < 0.05): no

